#: prefs.js:39
msgid ""
"Format per line: #RRGGBB distance(px). The last color does not need a "
"distance.\n"
"Example: red for 50px, then green for 50px, then blue forever."
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:43
msgid ""
"Format per line: #RRGGBB ratio(positive number). Values are normalized "
"automatically.\n"
"Example: ratios 1, 1, 1 split the trail into three equal parts."
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:47
msgid ""
"Format per line: #RRGGBB time(ms). All colors must have a time.\n"
"Example: red for 500ms, then green for 500ms, then blue for 500ms."
msgstr ""

